### Assign a user to a squadron (primary assignment)
POST {{baseUrl}}/squadrons/{{squadronId}}/assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "role": "STUDENT"
}

### Transfer a user's primary assignment to this squadron
PUT {{baseUrl}}/squadrons/{{squadronId}}/assignments/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "role": "STUDENT"
}

### Change a user's role within their primary squadron assignment
PUT {{baseUrl}}/squadrons/{{squadronId}}/assignments/{{userId}}/role
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "INSTRUCTOR"
}

### Revoke a user's primary assignment
PUT {{baseUrl}}/squadrons/{{squadronId}}/assignments/{{userId}}/revoke
